2002-12-06 Friday 12:27  Ben Kibbey <bjk@arbornet.org>

	* src/: cboard.c (1.7), cboard.h (1.3), input.c (1.2), pgn.c (1.3):
	
	add_pgn_data() now takes the index argument as a pointer to int and
	increments the index by itself.
	
	Dont send "pgnsave" when saving games. Dump the PNG tags and
	history by itself.
	
	Can edit and add PGN tags when saving.
	
	When loading and saving PNG files, remove and insert escape
	sequences as defined by the standard.

